\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Jesus the shepherd of the flock
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 good care taker who is kind
\par Let me also become your lamb
\par whom Thou savest by your death
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Oh! you laid down your holy life
\par entirely for all your lost sheep
\par you died because of me too
\par so let me also love you.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The sheep recognize their shepherd
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 the shepherd knows all his sheep
\par Let me also depend on you
\par precious as you are to me
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par so when the evil one cometh
\par I will not to him be his prey
\par You said, "Yours will never  lost
\par You know me, I know you too.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Jesus strengthen thou my weak faith
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Listen to me I am weak
\par should the lion attack fiercely
\par my voice echo in your ears,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Let me find favour in your sight
\par Answer me with your assurance
\par If I call please give me ears
\par Jesus, tell me "I've heard all.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. When I come to call on you Lord
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Jesus, listen to my call
\par Fill me fully with inner joy
\par and me to receive your grace
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Yes, you've heard me, in your dear name
\par all is "Yes" and " all is Amen"
\par I believe you son of  God
\par \pard       Your joy really is in me.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

